[[File:Mogre icon.png|left]]
'''Mogres''' are [[Slayer monsters]] and a type of [[ogre]] that are found in [[Mudskipper Point]], requiring level 32 [[Slayer]] to kill. Mogres appear when disturbed by the player, who must lure them using [[Fishing explosive]]s on an [[Ominous Fishing Spot]]. Previously, they could only be killed by players who had completed the [[Skippy and the Mogres]] [[miniquest]]. Since the release of [[Sailing]], Mogres swimming in the ocean can now be killed with cannons from the player's boat. Doing so does not require completion of Skippy and the Mogres and does not demand the use of Fishing explosives, but still requires having level 32 Slayer.  

Mogres can only be "lured" by clicking '''Use''' on the [[fishing explosive]]s in your inventory, then clicking on the ominous fishing spots while also standing a few tiles away. Although the ominous fishing spots do have an options to "Lure" or "Bait", both these options do nothing (even with fishing explosives) and instead merely say in chat ''"Something seems to have scared all the fishes away..."''

Mogres are usually killed by players searching for their unique drops of [[flippers]] or [[Mudskipper hat]]s.

Killing a Mogre is a requirement for completing the medium task set in the [[Falador Diary]].

