==Strategy==
[[File:Safespot west site.png|thumb|260x260px|A safespot for fighting WEST side lure.]]
Mogres can be [[safespot]]ted by using the [[fairy ring]], the [[STASH unit]] to the west, or along the shoreline. A [[tinderbox]] and [[log]]s can be brought to make fires, as mogres often drop raw fish. There is also an altar in [[Rimmington church]] just to the north of Mudskipper Point to restore prayer if using [[Protect from Melee]].

[[File:Mogre safespot.png|thumb|258x258px|A safespot for fighting Mogres.]]
[[File:Mogre Safespot for Halberd and Cannon.png|thumb|258x258px|A safespot for fighting Mogres using a Halberd and/or Cannon.]]

